{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/114782","id":3158694679,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc68RdsX","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114782","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114782.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114782.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114782","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/114782/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/114782/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114782/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/14d00cb542e319ec417de5c72c8c0347845de3f8","number":114782,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Fix boot splash on Macos","user":{"login":"jgill88","id":10379307,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMzc5MzA3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10379307?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jgill88","html_url":"https://github.com/jgill88","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jgill88/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jgill88/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jgill88/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jgill88/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jgill88/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jgill88/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jgill88/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jgill88/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jgill88/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Fixes #112143 Mac needs `force_process_and_drop_events` after showing the window. \r\n\r\nThe changes [here](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101980/changes#diff-26cc5f7d8ef06ac96e293f7556c6ffe89675d953086b3658cde39ae80be19e4eR3905) caused this init to happen in a different order.\r\n\r\nBefore the change:\r\n\r\n1. DisplayServerMacOS ctor\r\n     1. show_window\r\n     2. force_process_and_drop_events\r\n\r\nAfter #101980:\r\n\r\n1. DisplayServerMacOS ctor \r\n     1.  force_process_and_drop_events\r\n2. show_window\r\n\r\nI'm not familiar enough with the other platforms to know if it's safe to simply call `display_server->force_process_and_drop_events()` after `display_server->show_window`, just to satisfy MacOS' needs, so I have wrapped this in `#ifdef MACOS_ENABLED`. \r\n\r\nI also considered adding `force_process_and_drop_events` into the `show_window` method, but as I'm new to the codebase, I am unsure if it's safe to do that everywhere that show_window is called. Since the boot splash behavior that was broken was only in the ctor of DisplayServerMacOS, it seemed safest to call `force_process_and_drop_events` in setup2, as opposed to unconditionally calling it in show_window.\r\n\r\nIt would be nice if `show_window` were safe to use without the extra `force_process_and_drop_events`, that way some platform specifics can be ignored in setup2, so would be happy to move `force_process_and_drop_events` into `show_window` if it's safe.","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","description":"","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097780,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc3ODA=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/platform:macos","name":"platform:macos","description":"","color":"e4e4e4","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098111,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgxMTE=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:rendering","name":"topic:rendering","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-01-09T07:36:59Z","updated_at":"2026-01-22T06:11:04Z","closed_at":"2026-01-19T20:52:44Z","merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"9c6dbdf8341eee257b5fca1295425b6970c104a5","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"jgill88:fix-mac-bootsplash","ref":"fix-mac-bootsplash","repo":{"id":1127147259,"node_id":"R_kgDOQy7m-w","name":"godot","full_name":"jgill88/godot","owner":{"login":"jgill88","id":10379307,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMzc5MzA3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10379307?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jgill88","html_url":"https://github.com/jgill88","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jgill88/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jgill88/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jgill88/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jgill88/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jgill88/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jgill88/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jgill88/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jgill88/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jgill88/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"private":false,"fork":true,"archived":false,"disabled":false,"description":"Godot Engine – Multi-platform 2D and 3D game engine","homepage":"https://godotengine.org","language":"C++","visibility":"public","is_template":false,"topics":[],"forks_count":0,"forks":0,"stargazers_count":0,"watchers_coun